  "tightenedRule": {
    "rationale": "Anomalous beneficiary diversity at merchant Quickmart in a short window (6 distinct beneficiaries, ~3am off-hours) is consistent with a mule-merchant fraud pattern. Blocking this merchant pending manual review.",
